#: kcmlayout.cpp:190
msgid ""
"Here you can choose a variant of the selected additional keyboard layout. "
"Layout variants usually represent different key maps for the same language. "
"For example, Ukrainian layout might have four variants: basic, winkeys (as "
"in Windows), typewriter (as in typewriters) and phonetic (each Ukrainian "
"letter is placed on a transliterated latin one)."
